TITLE Pyrite oxidation, equilibrium, with constant atmospheric O2
SOLUTION 1 Pure water, initial neutral pH
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite   0.0  0.1
    Goethite 0.0  0
    Gypsum   0.0  0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -totals S
END
